From 16837f2849c7321653b48a3d874ef74739958c5e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rolotrealanis98 <122947376+rolotrealanis98@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 07:25:09 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] j716s: 16-inch M5 Pro board DT, measured pmgr boot state,
 GCC=1 kernel builds

J716s runs the full 18-core SKU (runtime ADT cpu0-17), same MTP children as J714s; trackpad firmware tpmtfw-j716s.bin. cpufreq, storage-net and pmgr regenerated from the J716s runtime ADT are byte-identical to the committed J714s files; 0 of 273 shared PMGR domains differ at handover. Booted tethered to an initramfs shell with maxcpus=1 (USB gadget up, 10.55.0.2 answers ping).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
